join Charity (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Charity (Warm)
Charity: She's been assigned a desk. Her own desk, with her name on a card.
Charity: She's put a stone on it. Just a stone she found. To make it hers.
- That's a good sign
	Hope: That's a good sign.
	Charity: It's a very good sign. It's also —
	Charity: I keep catching myself planning past my posting. Where the shade will be when that tree fills out. Whether we'd want a bigger place, eventually.
	Charity: Those aren't posting thoughts.
- What are they?
	Hope: What are they?
	Charity: You know precisely what they are. You've been having them yourself since about March.
	Charity: We'll neither of us say it out loud yet. That's allowed.
[signal arg="hearts:charity:2"]
set {GameState.charity_home_realisation} = true
